        "language": "en",
        "text": {
          "status": "generated",
          "div": "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" lang=\"en\" xml:lang=\"en\"><h1>Imaging report: Bertil Åkesson, X-rays of 9 and 10 November 2026</h1><h3>X-ray of the pelvis and right hip, 2026-11-09</h3><p>Displaced medial femoral neck fracture on the right, Garden IV. No other fractures.</p><h3>X-ray of the chest, 2026-11-09</h3><p>Slightly enlarged cardiac silhouette. Emphysematous changes in both lungs. No infiltrates and no congestion.</p><h3>X-ray of the right hip, post-operative, 2026-11-10</h3><p>Cemented bipolar hemiarthroplasty in correct position. No sign of dislocation or periprosthetic fracture.</p><h2>Impression</h2><p>Displaced medial femoral neck fracture on the right, Garden IV, and no other fractures. After surgery, a cemented bipolar hemiarthroplasty in correct position, with no sign of dislocation or periprosthetic fracture. Chest: slightly enlarged cardiac silhouette and emphysematous changes in both lungs, with no infiltrates and no congestion.</p><p>Radiology, Landspítali. Acknowledged by Dr Guðrún Jónsdóttir.</p></div>"
        },
